.TH TODO 1 "2024-06-01" "v2.0.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
todo - Command-line To-Do List Manager

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B todo
\[
.I COMMAND
] \[
.I OPTIONS
] \[
.I ARGUMENTS
]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B todo
is a powerful Python-based CLI application for managing hierarchical to-do lists, subtasks, priorities, tags, categories, notes, and more. Data is stored in \$HOME/.todo\_data.json for persistent and private usage.

.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B add
Add a new primary task.
.TP
.B subtask
Add a subtask under a primary task.
.TP
.B pending
Mark a task or subtask as in-progress.
.TP
.B hold
Mark a task or subtask as on-hold.
.TP
.B complete
Mark one or more tasks/subtasks as complete.
.TP
.B delete
Delete one or more tasks/subtasks.
.TP
.B edit
Edit fields on a task or subtask.
.TP
.B list
List tasks and subtasks, with options for filtering, sorting, and display customization.
.TP
.B --version
Show the application version.
.TP
.B -h, --help
Show the help message.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR --due " \[DATE]"
Due date (YYYY-MM-DD, or natural language like 'tomorrow', '1 week', etc.).
.TP
.BR --AssignedTo " \[NAME]"
Assign the task or subtask to a user.
.TP
.BR --priority " \[critical|high|medium|low]"
Set priority level (colorized in output).
.TP
.BR --notes " \[TEXT]"
Attach notes to a task or subtask.
.TP
.BR --tags " \[TAG1 TAG2 ...]"
Attach tags for filtering or categorization.
.TP
.BR --categories " \[CAT1 CAT2 ...]"
Attach categories for filtering or organization.
.TP
.BR --all
Show all tasks (including completed) in listing.
.TP
.BR --sort " \[id|due|assigned|priority]"
Sort tasks in listings.
.TP
.BR --help
Show help message for any command.

.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Add a task:
.B todo add "Write report" --due 2025-06-10 --AssignedTo Alice --priority high --notes "Include exec summary" --tags work urgent --categories business
.TP
Add a subtask:
.B todo subtask 1 "Draft outline" --due 2025-06-12 --notes "Use Q2 template" --tags outline
.TP
List all tasks, sorted by due date:
.B todo list --sort due
.TP
List tasks with a specific tag:
.B todo list --tags urgent
.TP
Mark a subtask as in progress:
.B todo pending 1-2
.TP
Complete multiple tasks/subtasks:
.B todo complete 1-1 2 3
.TP
Delete multiple tasks or subtasks:
.B todo delete 4 5-2

.SH FILES
.TP
.I \$HOME/.todo\_data.json
The JSON data file used for storing tasks.

